{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"11f7002f-1250-416f-bd07-34f6030c1de7","agentId":"a2dc46b9af8a17e14","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 Reformulation Linearization Technique (RLT) 在 2D placement / packing 类几何组合优化的实证应用，2024-2026 进展。\n\n**背景：** Round 7 spectral 那个 agent 顺带提了 RLT 但没深入。RLT 是 Sherali-Adams 的几何强化版，理论上对 binary + bilinear 项 LP relaxation 有显著强化。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. RLT-1 / RLT-2 / RLT-h 层级理论\n2. RLT 在 2D bin/strip packing 实证（Lodi/Monaci/Sherali）\n3. RLT for facility location / placement\n4. PORTA / RLT-POPCO / Sherali-Adams 工具栈\n5. RLT 跟我们 CP-SAT 的接口路径（生成 cut 喂回去？）\n6. 我们 master_model bilinear 项（如 facility position × ghost coord）能否 RLT 强化\n7. 工程成本估算\n\n输出末尾：\"是否值得 PoC + 具体公式建议\""},"uuid":"54ccfc95-85b9-42c5-9fe3-8ec941129b6c","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:24:50.283Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
